  ('Paracetamol 500mg Tablet', 'Paracetamol', 'Dolo 500', 'Micro Labs', (select id from public.categories where slug = 'pain-fever'), 30, 34, '15 tablets', false, 'tablet', 'Paracetamol 500mg tablet, a common pain reliever and fever reducer.', 'Relief from mild to moderate pain such as headache, body ache, toothache, and to bring down fever.', 'Generally well tolerated. Rare: skin rash; liver strain with overdose or heavy alcohol use.'),
