  ('Aspirin 75mg Tablet', 'Aspirin', 'Ecosprin 75', 'USV', (select id from public.categories where slug = 'pain-fever'), 12, 15, '14 tablets', false, 'tablet', 'Low-dose aspirin 75mg, an anti-platelet tablet.', 'Helps prevent blood clots; used long-term to lower risk of heart attack and stroke on medical advice.', 'Stomach irritation, easy bruising or bleeding. Take after food.'),
